# Testing

- Prefer unit + contract tests beside the code (`*.test.ts`)
- Plugins: run `npm run verify:plugins`; add fixtures for parse/normalize when practical
- Do not ship fake business mocks that pretend production behavior
- CI runs format, lint, typecheck, workspace tests, plugin verify, compose/stack validate
- Docs: `docs/TESTING.md`
